('Four','rest, recovery, and deliberate withdrawal before the mind can continue','a recumbent figure lies beneath one horizontal sword while three hang above in a quiet star-lit sanctuary'),
('Five','conflict, hollow victory, and the ethical cost of winning','one figure gathers three swords while two others walk toward the water, leaving two blades behind under broken clouds'),
('Six','transition, passage, and carrying experience toward calmer ground','a ferryman guides a veiled passenger and child across water with six swords standing upright in the boat'),
('Seven','strategy, secrecy, and the unstable line between privacy and deception','a figure carries five swords away from a camp while two remain planted behind and watchtowers glow in the distance'),
('Eight','restriction, fear, and the prison formed by limited perception','a loosely bound blindfolded figure stands among eight swords on wet ground with an open castle path behind'),
('Nine','anxiety, sleeplessness, and thoughts becoming more absolute in darkness','a figure sits upright in bed beneath nine swords while quilt mosaics show unresolved stories and dawn waits outside'),
('Ten','a painful ending, finality, and the first light beyond collapse','a fallen figure lies beneath ten swords as black sky gives way to a gold horizon over still water'),
('Page','alert curiosity, difficult messages, and the mind learning to test information','a young page holds a raised sword in restless wind while birds and shifting clouds reveal many competing signals'),
('Knight','direct action, argument, and speed that may outrun nuance','an armored knight charges beneath storm clouds with sword forward and wind bending every tree'),
('Queen','discernment, independence, and truth delivered with clean boundaries','a queen sits beneath an open sky with one sword upright and one hand extended toward approaching facts'),
('King','reasoned authority, law, and the responsibility to use truth without cruelty','a king sits between balanced clouds with an upright sword, butterfly carvings, and a clear road through mountains'),
],
'Pentacles': [
('Ace','material opportunity, embodiment, and a practical seed with real potential','a hand presents one golden pentacle above a garden path leading through an arch toward mountains'),
('Two','adaptation, competing demands, and keeping resources in motion','a dancer loops two pentacles inside an infinity ribbon while ships rise and fall on waves behind'),
('Three','skill, collaboration, and work made stronger by different expertise','three artisans study a cathedral mosaic beneath three pentacles set into an architectural arch'),
('Four','security, possession, and the point where protection becomes constriction','a seated figure holds one pentacle to the chest, balances one on the crown, and pins two beneath the feet'),
('Five','material hardship, exclusion, and support visible but difficult to access','two travelers cross snow beneath a stained-glass window containing five pentacles and warm interior light'),
('Six','generosity, power, and the terms hidden inside giving and receiving','a standing figure weighs coins on a scale while distributing six pentacles to two kneeling recipients'),
('Seven','assessment, patience, and deciding whether continued investment is worthwhile','a gardener leans on a tool before a vine bearing seven pentacles, studying growth that is real but incomplete'),
('Eight','craft, apprenticeship, and mastery built through repetition','an artisan engraves pentacles at a bench while seven completed pieces hang in sequence beside the eighth'),
('Nine','self-sufficiency, cultivated pleasure, and independence supported by discipline','a robed figure stands in a vineyard with nine pentacles, a hooded falcon, and a distant estate'),
('Ten','legacy, family systems, and wealth that extends beyond one lifetime','elders, adults, children, and dogs gather beneath an arch where ten pentacles form a tree-like constellation'),
('Page','study, grounded curiosity, and a practical opportunity requiring care','a page holds one pentacle at eye level in a flowering field while a tilled valley waits beyond'),
('Knight','reliability, routine, and patient action that values completion over speed','a still knight holds a pentacle on a dark horse before a carefully ploughed field under a steady sky'),
('Queen','grounded care, resourcefulness, and making material life hospitable','a queen cradles a pentacle in a lush garden where a rabbit, roses, and fruit show attentive cultivation'),
('King','material mastery, stewardship, and the ethical use of resources','a king sits among vines, bulls, coins, and a secure city, holding pentacle and scepter without leaving the earth'),
],
}
